{{Quote|And now hearing you say that makes me the luckiest little Pa'lowick the galaxy has ever known.|Sy Snootles, to Ziro the Hutt|<ref name="Hunt for Ziro">{{TCW|Hunt for Ziro}}</ref>}}
'''Pa'lowicks''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] of long-[[limb]]ed [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[humanoid]]s that had spotted skin, [[eye]]s that protruded from the tops of their heads, and trunk-like [[mouth]]s. [[Sy Snootles]], the lead singer of the [[Max Rebo Band]], was a Pa'lowick.

==Biology and appearance==
Pa'lowick's were a [[species]] of [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[humanoid]]s. Their most distinctive feature was their trunk-like,<ref name="Pa'lowick" /> 30-[[centimeter]]<ref name="RotJ novel">[[Star Wars: Return of the Jedi (paperback novel)|''Star Wars: Return of the Jedi'' junior novelization]]</ref> snout that ended with a large pair of [[Mouth|lips]],<ref name="Ezra's Gamble">''[[Ezra's Gamble]]''</ref> while a pair of retractable [[Tooth|tusks]] protruded from their second mouth.<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> This helped them cope with the variety of conditions associated with living in [[swamp]]s, and Pa'lowicks were able to use their snout as a snorkel.<ref name="VE" /> Pa'lowicks had four<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> long, thin [[limb]]s<ref name="Pa'lowick" /> attached their rounded body. Their [[Color|yellow]] skin was covered in blue<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> or purple spots,<ref name="Stop, Thief" /> which provided camouflage in the [[swamp]]s of their [[homeworld]].<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> A pair of bulbous<ref name="Ezra's Gamble" /> blue<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> [[eye]]s protruded from their head, right above their snout.<ref name="Pa'lowick" /> Instead of a [[heart]],<ref name="Max Rebo">{{Databank|max-rebo|Max Rebo}}</ref> Pa'lowicks had an organ known as a [[fluid sac]].<ref name="Hunt for Ziro" />

==Pa'lowicks in the galaxy==
[[Sy Snootles]], a Pa'lowick [[Homeworld|from]] [[Lowick]], was a popular singer and part-time [[bounty hunter]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> though in secret she worked as a [[spy]] for the [[Hutt Clan]].<ref name="Sy Snootles" /> She later chose to focus on her singing career and helped form the [[Max Rebo Band]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> becoming its lead singer.<ref name="Pa'lowick" /> [[Unidentified Pa'lowick announcer|Another]] Pa'lowick worked as an announcer for the illegal [[Gladiator Night]] sporting event held at [[Monad Outpost]] on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]].<ref name="Ezra's Gamble" />

==Behind the scenes==
Pa'lowicks first appeared in [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']].<ref name="Return of the Jedi" />

